# ============================================================================
# Build artifacts (preserve intentionally committed .pyc)
# ============================================================================
# Python bytecode caches are auto-regenerated on import.
# NOTE: a small number of .pyc files under src/ab-cloud-3d/build/ are
# committed intentionally to preserve the exact runtime state of the
# verification runs. Do not delete them.
!src/ab-cloud-3d/build/*.pyc

